Explanation:

- We added a new entry `{ type: 'bpmn:Group', order: { level: 7 } }` at the top of the `orders` array.
- Level 7 is chosen so that groups render above most process elements (which are ≤6) but below things you explicitly want on top (e.g. flows at 9 or labels at the root). Labels remain highest because they are shimmed to `canvas.getRootElement()` with index –1.
